        "created_at": "2017-02-02T00:00:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There have been quite a few instances of us forumites meeting up at events, over the past few years. This one is a classic that recently came up for those of us on Facebook, that I thought I'd share with the community. There were a few of us there for that one!  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grin.png?v=9\" title=\":grin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grin:\">  I'll let folks identify themselves if they'd like to, but me, Andy, Craig, and Evan are obvious. (Some moreso than others <em>cough</em>EvanInATux<em>cough</em>.)</p>\n<p>Anyone else have meet-up pictures they want to share? </p>\n<p> </p>",
        "post_number": 1,
